+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+# Copyright 2026 S2Arm contributors
+# native-test-vp_prog_pick：#674 补齐变体选 program 的纯 C 逻辑（graphics/nvn/gfx/nvn/vp_prog_pick.h）
